ner noreferrer\">SEC regulatory proposal marks \u2018important\u2019 step forward from \u2018inapt\u2019 crypto rules: Commissioner Peirce</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
